		<outline text="We are The Angels Wing - a community of independent NFT collectors and artists. We hold a public podcast every Sunday and talk with emerging artists about their artwork, web3, NFT pricing strategies, NFT marketplaces, and much more. We also showcase their beautiful artwork in a virtual 3D gallery and give them visibility to connect with potential collectors. More topics: Ethereum, Tezos, DeFi, Metaverse, Blockchain, Crypto&#xA;" type="rss" xmlUrl="https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/feed.theangelswing.art/the-angels-wing.xml" title="The Angels&#39; Wing | NFT Art Podcast"></outline>
